sward+@CMU.EDU (David Reeve Sward) writes:
: is there any point in throwing food at your pet, or a monster you tamed?

Yup.  Pets (in whatever shape they take) need food to survive just as your
adventurer does.  Usually they get what they need by eating corpses, but
they can whimper, become rebellious, go wild or even die if deprived of
food for a significant time!  Throwing food at them is the most direct way
to feed them.  Throwing food at a wild dog or cat will tame it.

And throwing food to pets can train them to perform certain tricks, such as
ripping off shops or stepping on cursed items.  But that's for another
post...
